t(interval)\n```\n\nAnd GPU move path: `self.owner._queue_hover(e, 0)` → `self.owner._queue_hover(e, 16, restart=False)`.\n\nCheck line endings of these regions: the hover code was added by prior run — probably LF. The mouseMoveEvent GPU branch comment — also prior run. Let me do these with python too, handling both ending styles.", "summary": []}
